1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Expense Sharing Service dashboard
Group totals, member balances, and spending analytics

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Select a group to view its expenses, suggested repayments, and members.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Add an expense with a description, category, payer, and optional receipt.

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Choose an equal split or enter custom amounts for each member.

5
00:00:51,000 --> 00:01:04,000
The new expense updates totals, balances, and category spending automatically.

6
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Filter expense history by date, category, or description.

7
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Settlement suggestions show the simplest payments needed to settle the group.

8
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Record a full or partial payment after money has been paid.

9
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Export the group expense history to a formatted Excel report.

10
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:05,000
The friendly API guide explains how the dashboard talks to the server.

11
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:18,000
FastAPI documentation provides an interactive reference for every endpoint.
